}
\details{
\enumerate{
\item \strong{Recalibration on your own world stream} (mandatory, not a
switch): \code{reps} null worlds of the same design, strict cut
convention \verb{cut* = min\{k : FA(k) <= alpha\}}.
\item \strong{Power across the effect grid} with the recalibrated cut.
